{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A cozy, upgrade filled, adventure that goes from curious kitty to unstoppable leaf-crunching beast.\u00a0 Stomp, explore, and uncover cozy forest secrets with your magical fairy guide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Time your triple stomps to the music for a special attack</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920060/extras/649f88a9d2527200a5ce29a6fc713127.poster.avif?t=1754679244\" aria-label=\"Time your triple stomps to the music for a special attack\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920060/extras/649f88a9d2527200a5ce29a6fc713127.webm?t=1754679244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920060/extras/649f88a9d2527200a5ce29a6fc713127.mp4?t=1754679244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect hidden treasures</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920060/extras/d4399178ebf2f674ebb8fddeeef5e7f6.poster.avif?t=1754679244\" aria-label=\"Collect hidden treasures\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920060/extras/d4399178ebf2f674ebb8fddeeef5e7f6.webm?t=1754679244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920060/extras/d4399178ebf2f674ebb8fddeeef5e7f6.mp4?t=1754679244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survive wild winds</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920060/extras/d4c173b6f00cd31e77c26fe98935c216.poster.avif?t=1754679244\" aria-label=\"Survive wild winds\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920060/extras/d4c173b6f00cd31e77c26fe98935c216.webm?t=1754679244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920060/extras/d4c173b6f00cd31e77c26fe98935c216.mp4?t=1754679244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customize your character</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920060/extras/737adf092fa7d2598cbc9118a05d4ed7.poster.avif?t=1754679244\" aria-label=\"Customize your character\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920060/extras/737adf092fa7d2598cbc9118a05d4ed7.webm?t=1754679244\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3920060/extras/737adf092fa7d2598cbc9118a05d4ed7.mp4?t=1754679244\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cozy Crunch</strong> is a gentle, whimsical adventure where you guide a curious cat through a crunchy leaf-filled forest using a magical fairy (your mouse cursor). Stomp leaves, uncover secrets, and explore hand-crafted areas filled with cozy atmosphere and charming surprises.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simple point and click controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 hand crafted areas (only first area in demo)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A hidden rhythm mechanic - time your triple stomps to the music to unleash powerful waves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Relaxing original soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Character customization (limited options in demo, 50+ variations in full game)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple progression paths with quests, hidden items, and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Demo Length</strong>: ~30-40+ mins</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play the\u00a0<i><strong>Cozy Crunch</strong></i>\u00a0demo and prepare to leaf your worries behind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About the game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hi! I\u2019m Jo, a solo indie developer, and this is my first game. Cozy Crunch is inspired by the charm of classic online flash games. Simple, relaxing, and designed to be enjoyed in a single cozy evening. I hope it brings you a bit of calm and delight, just like it did for me while creating it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try the\u00a0<strong><i>Cozy Crunch </i></strong>demo<strong><i> </i></strong>today and prepare to leaf your worries behind.<br><br><i>Note:</i> <i>The demo version includes only the first area of the world and the associated upgrades within that area. There is a small second area included to wrap up the demo that is not in the final game.</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Crunch a leaf","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3920060/6475893d23eb99c38ef92a1206cf3d84f50c6a5b.jpg"},{"name":"Roast a leaf","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3920060/07ab0afef36e53aac8fe4fe17935806b7a569dd6.jpg"},{"name":"Activate a windstorm","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3920060/02cb7ec73707aabbb2640f99480fd7eab4cb0377.jpg"},{"name":"Become a Real Civil Engineer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/ap